course: dictionary
lesson: 15818
title: Unconnected: not joined, not related
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Unconnected means not joined or linked to something. A wire that is not joined to the battery cannot carry electricity, so the bulb stays off.
explain: It can also mean not related, with nothing to do with each other. «The two fires were unconnected» tells you one fire did not cause the other.
explain: To check the meaning, swap in a phrase like "not joined" or "not related" and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Unconnected means not joined or linked to something.
fact: Unconnected also means not related, with nothing to do with each other.
fact: «The two fires were unconnected» means one fire did not cause the other.
fact: In maths, unconnected dots have no line between them.
fact: The opposite of unconnected is connected, which means joined or related.
exercise: «The loose wire was unconnected, so the lamp stayed dark.» What does unconnected mean here? | Broken into tiny pieces | Very bright | Covered in paint | *Not joined to anything
exercise: «The thefts in the two towns were unconnected.» What does unconnected suggest? | The towns were joined by a road | *The thefts had nothing to do with each other | The police caught the thief | The same thief did both thefts
exercise: In maths, two dots are unconnected. What does that mean? | They are the same colour | They are joined by a thick line | *There is no line between them | They are bigger than the other dots
test: «The rain and the broken bench were unconnected events.» Which word means the same as unconnected? | Joined | Linked | Equal | *Unrelated
test: Mia says, «My tablet is unconnected to the Wi-Fi.» What does this tell you? | The tablet is brand new | The Wi-Fi is very fast | The tablet is fully charged | *The tablet is not joined to the Wi-Fi
exam: Which sentence uses unconnected correctly? | «The dots were unconnected, so a line joined every one.» | *«The two bike crashes were unconnected: one did not cause the other.» | «The unconnected lamp glowed brightly because it was plugged in.»
